{"id":"236464","name":"桂圆果酱","author":"ZHAI翟","authorId":"1308807","desc":"","cover":"images/236464/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"新鲜桂圆","amount":"500克"},{"name":"砂糖","amount":"100克"},{"name":"柠檬","amount":"1个"}],"sub":[{"name":"食盐","amount":"2克"},{"name":"玉米淀粉","amount":"3勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"桂圆剥好，加入盐和糖。","img":"images/236464/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"一个新鲜柠檬，榨出汁，过滤杂质。","img":"images/236464/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"倒入桂圆中一半的柠檬汁。","img":"images/236464/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"搅拌，小火加热，慢慢熬煮10分钟。","img":"images/236464/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"玉米淀粉加水混成汁。","img":"images/236464/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入沸腾的桂圆中，熬制浓稠，汤汁透明，关火后加入另一半柠檬汁。","img":"images/236464/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"趁热放入容器中，室温晾凉。","img":"images/236464/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}